author ai
group features/cli
note path-pin <name> <index> <file> <start> <end>: re-anchor one step on new lines (1-based, inclusive), keeping its note, its parent, its link and its place in the tree. It is the hand fix for a step that repin could not place: the symbol is gone or fewer than half its lines survive. The pinning author is recorded on the step, so the owner sees who moved it.

